  "nl_text": "The database schema for the database named rschema_0498 consists of five tables: student_table, class_table, sports_team_table, school_table, and dormitory_table.\nThe student_table represents a collection of students, with each student having an id, name, gender, age, dormitory_id, and class_id. The student_id is the primary key of this table, and it is used to uniquely identify each student. The foreign keys dormitory_id and class_id reference the dormitory_table and class_table respectively, with cascade delete and update rules.\nThe class_table holds information about classes, with each class having a class_id, class_teacher, number_of_students, and location. The class_id is the primary key of this table.\nThe sports_team_table contains information about sports teams, with each team having a team_name, activity_time, coach, activity_venue, team_id, and affiliated_school. The team_id is the primary key of this table, and the foreign key affiliated_school references the school_table.\nThe school_table contains information about schools, with each school having a school_id and school_name. The school_id is the primary key of this table.\nFinally, the dormitory_table holds information about dormitories, with each dormitory having a dormitory_id, building_number, administrator, and dormitory_capacity. The dormitory_id is the primary key of this table.\nAll columns in these tables allow null values, and they use the InnoDB engine with a default character set of utf8mb3.",
  "gold_question": "System Description\nDescribes a school management system\n\nMain functions of the system\n1: Student management: including basic information of students (such as student ID, name, gender, age) and accommodation information (such as dormitory number, building number, number of people, administrator)\n2: Class management: including basic information of classes (such as class number) and classroom information\n3: Sports team management: including basic information of sports teams (such as team name, activity time, coach, activity venue)\n4: School management: including basic information of schools (such as school name) and information of sports teams",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_deepseek/0498.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0498\nCREATE TABLE `student_table` (\n  `student_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `gender` varchar(10) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `age` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `dormitory_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `class_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`student_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `student_table_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`dormitory_id`) REFERENCES `dormitory_table` (`dormitory_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `student_table_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`class_id`) REFERENCES `class_table` (`class_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `class_table` (\n  `class_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `class_teacher` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `number_of_students` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`class_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `sports_team_table` (\n  `team_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `team_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `activity_time` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `coach` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `activity_venue` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `affiliated_school` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`team_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `sports_team_table_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`affiliated_school`) REFERENCES `school_table` (`school_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `school_table` (\n  `school_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `school_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`school_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `dormitory_table` (\n  `dormitory_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `building_number` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `administrator` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `dormitory_capacity` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`dormitory_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
